  <title>SET MEMOWIDTH Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET MEMOWIDTH command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET MEMOWIDTH Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Specifies the width of the output of memo fields.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET MEMOWIDTH TO [&lt;nColumns&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;nColumns&gt;<tab />The number of columns. When the value is omitted the default value 50 is used.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The value is stored in the runtime state under Set.MemoWidth.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">See Also</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_MEMOBLOCK">SET MEMOBLOCKSIZE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_HEADINGS">SET HEADINGS</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
